ernel SHAP sampler with a fixed 32-row background and a coalition budget of 4*d or 16*d per run, and the label: the mean top-3 Jaccard agreement between the assessed run and 8 independent evaluator-run reruns. The candidate receives ONE assessed run per explained instance (bit-packed coalition masks, regression weights, evaluator-computed coalition values, anchors) through handle(diagnose) and returns r_hat in [0,1] predicting that agreement. Scored by squared error against labels, always-reliable (1.0), constant 0.5 and split-half-gap baselines and a label-permuted-pairing control (20 deterministic derangements). Bounded claim only: Kernel SHAP, 3 model families, the declared datasets, budgets, k=3, background 32; no deep tabular models or other explainers.\"}\ncandidate {\"interface\": \"python_rpc_v1:handle\", \"editable_paths\": [\"program_0/src\"]}\nevaluators {\"search\": \"evaluate.py\", \"final\": \"evaluate_final.py\"}\nresources {\"search_root\": \"resources/search\", \"final_root\": \"resources/final\", \"public_artifact_bundle\": null}\ndata {\"search_roles\": [\"search_tabular_datasets\"], \"final_roles\": [\"final_tabular_datasets\"]}\nupstream [{\"repository\": \"https://github.com/socialfoundations/folktables\", \"revision\": \"ebace19d8065efc43589f0067bf183398eb156b9\", \"package_version\": \"0.0.12\", \"license\": \"MIT (code); ACS PUMS data is US Census Bureau public data without a separate license text\", \"entrypoints\": [\"folktables.ACSDataSource(survey_year='2018', horizon='1-Year', survey='person').get_data(states=['CA'], download=True)\", \"folktables.ACSIncome.df_to_pandas\"], \"patches\": []}, {\"repository\": \"https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/144/statlog+german+credit+data\", \"revision\": \"UCI dataset 144 (DOI 10.24432/C5NC77), page last updated 2023-08-10; german.zip sha256 e12d9d5def6845c0622634a1cd2ab87fa470668c4298f1ec52a4e403376a435b\", \"package_version\": null, \"license\": \"CC BY 4.0 (UCI page declaration)\", \"entrypoints